# This fork removes T3 Connect. Builds ignore relay and Clerk settings
# (T3CODE_RELAY_URL, T3CODE_CLERK_*, VITE_CLERK_*, EXPO_PUBLIC_CLERK_*), so there is
# nothing to configure here for remote access. Use Tailscale or your own Cloudflare
# Tunnel instead: see docs/user/remote-access.md.
# Do not add server-side secrets to this file.

# Optional: signed macOS passkey builds.
# T3CODE_APPLE_TEAM_ID=ABC1234567
# T3CODE_MACOS_PROVISIONING_PROFILE=/absolute/path/to/t3code.provisionprofile
